02 — COMPLETE UX ARCHITECTURE REDESIGN

Review the current navigation architecture and simplify it.

The application must have a clear primary navigation system.

Use a maximum of four primary destinations where appropriate:

HOME

The main action center.

SHIPMENTS

All deliveries, active shipments, upcoming reservations, completed deliveries, and shipment details.

ACTIVITY

